WEBVTT

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:34.560
Episode 13

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:52.490
Hold it!

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.030
Too late.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:02.340
Shikimi-san!

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.400
Stop it!

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.970
We'll take you on!

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.670
Choose any angle you want!

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.950
It's dangerous! Don't use guns!

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.110
Now, seize this opening!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.110
What are you guys doing there? Get them!

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.450
Okay!

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.090
Too bad.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:29.220
Chorogi-sensei!

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:36.230
You think losers like you can get away from here?

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:40.010
If we were trying to get away, we wouldn't have come here in the first place!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.070
I thought about that too!

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:43.980
You guys are persistent.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.580
We don't have time to fight you now!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:51.280
Still, I heard that you like fighting the most.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.500
That's all a bluff.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.450
There are things more important than fighting!

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.820
We have to save Shikimi-san!

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.490
Save her?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.340
We need to open up her path as a ninja, so that she can become stronger.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.800
This is all for her benefit.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.170
How can you say that?

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.600
She is... just like me.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.810
Shikimi-san doesn't want that!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.040
How do you know?

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.460
How, you ask?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.710
B-Because we're friends.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.880
Friendship among kunoichi? Don't make me laugh!

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.950
That nonsense only suits inferior students of ninja!

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.060
She dodged my attacks?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:38.060
It's you, teacher, who taught those ninjutsu to us inferior students!

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.370
This guy's super-slow!

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:43.570
You're naive!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:47.640
Himawari!

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.500
What?

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.980
Principal Yatsugashira!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:05.520
Perhaps you forgot that Principal Yatsugashira and Takechi-sensei are allies.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.750
Himawari-san, go on.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.760
Hurry and save Shikimi-san.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:11.660
Yes!

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:15.260
I'll take you on!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.600
Like I'd let you go!

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:21.140
Stop this useless struggle.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.640
I no longer follow your orders.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.880
Get out of my way!

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.460
Everyone!

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.280
Sabisuke! Thank goodness you're back!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.600
Boss!

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.450
Wabisuke!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.730
Sabisuke, it's still too early to celebrate!

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.760
Because there's no end to them,
I'll use the Mist Concealment Technique!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.230
Now, let's start!

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.120
Shikimi-san!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.200
I see.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:25.700
Because she was raised by a strict master, she knows nothing of love.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.940
The only remarkable thing about her is her ninjutsu.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.570
That's your greatest strength, right?

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:38.060
A lonely girl whom no one can or will love.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.590
You're lying.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:42.950
I was... lonely.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.450
Stop it!

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:50.230
As I'd expect from the top student, you're resisting more strongly than anyone else.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.290
You'll be freed from your agony soon.

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.240
Yes, that's the way.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.580
Shikimi-san!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.770
Don't get in the way!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:08.880
Sh-Shikimi-san! Please get a hold of yourself!

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.880
I-I'm on my way!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:16.140
I have a lot of comrades who are
exciting friends and loyal partners.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.650
Shikimi-san!

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.820
Splendid!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:26.770
This girl has chosen the path of becoming a gifted ninja.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:30.550
Well then, let's finish up.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:34.330
That's...

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.280
Shikimi-san, you're not alone!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:43.080
Don't you have a wonderful comrade in Nanafushi-san?!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:48.560
You worried about us even when you were in danger.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:52.190
How can you say you're lonely
when you care about others so deeply?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.590
Wake up, Shikimi-san!

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.690
Let bygones be bygones!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.360
What's important is what lies ahead.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.630
That's what you, Grandma, and everyone else taught me!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.440
Hima... wari...

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.070
This resistance...

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.110
Wh-What does it mean?

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:15.500
What happened?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.880
Detecting a strong rejection response.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:21.120
It's different from before. I can't suppress it!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.550
What do you mean, "different"?

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:25.620
Raise the level.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.410
That's impossible.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:29.000
It's dangerous to remodel a subject by force!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.610
She'll die!

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.130
Shut up! Get away!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.490
It will all be over soon!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.190
I won't let that happen!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.430
Shikimi-san, I'll save you now!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.350
Wh-What should I do?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.800
It's our turn now.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.660
That's why you're still not good enough.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.190
Really... We just can't let her fight by herself.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.230
Everyone!

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:02.200
Huh?

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.400
What should we do?

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.930
This looks super-bad.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.570
I see.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.430
The method Takechi-sensei used back then...

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.470
Ninja Technique: Three-Point Fissure.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.210
Ninja Technique: Three-Point Fissure, right?

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.450
Got it.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.560
Let's do it!

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.950
Shikimi-san!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.250
I was about to die.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.900
Stupid Himawari.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.960
S-Sorry.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.100
But, according to my information,

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.880
although she's a bit dumb and clumsy,
she never gives up and always does her best.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.490
Whenever people see Himawari's smile,
they gain courage and try harder.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.610
She's listening!

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.970
Anyway, I think so too.

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:59.480
This isn't the time to relax!

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.250
Hayato-dono.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:05.520
While you stand around spouting nonsense,

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.990
you're going to experience a specially created cataclysm.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.460
Oh no!

00:09:10.460 --> 00:09:12.830
It's the Dimensional Explosion Device.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:20.460
The aircraft carrier exploded while I was away, and my experiment failed.

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:24.070
Although I don't want matters to end like this, don't think badly of me.

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:25.840
Stop it!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.840
Farewell.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.380
Damn it. Hold it right there!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.950
Hayato-dono!

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:35.160
The captured students are still inside!

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:35.680
Right.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.420
We're going to save them.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.740
What are you doing, Himawari?

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:40.920
Hurry and go!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.470
But...

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.510
Yusura-chan!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.260
Yonezawa-kun! Momota!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.960
We're here to help too!

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.470
Himawari, we're counting on you to rescue everyone.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.470
Right!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.200
Let's hurry too.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:10.720
W-Watch out!

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:15.530
The cave's gonna explode!

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.230
Vice-Principal Chorogi!

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.200
What were we doing?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:29.350
Did he control us by amplifying our anxieties and desires?

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.480
Save the students.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.210
Yes, Principal.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.720
We'll help too!

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.540
Me too.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:42.860
Hayato-dono.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.990
There you are.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:50.230
You won't get away!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.570
Hayato-dono!

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:08.730
Himawari!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.330
Why are you following me?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.110
It's my duty to protect you, Hayato-dono.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.960
Thank goodness I made it.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.430
O-Ouch.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.930
Hayato-dono, are you all right?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.430
You're heavy.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.170
Get off me...

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:35.940
Who's there?

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.040
Y-You are...

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.180
Get out of my way!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:47.180
I won't let you get away!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:51.890
Hayato!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.620
Take that and escape!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.420
But...

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:57.630
I can't pilot it.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:04.370
That escape pod won't fly unless someone with the proper identification is on board.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.820
Do you mean this?

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.640
You guys are...

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:23.390
Tsubaki will handle the rest!

00:12:24.990 --> 00:12:26.050
Hop in, quick.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.540
Tsubaki!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.390
But...

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.450
Takechi-dono will be fine.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.890
Because Takechi-dono... Back then...

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.260
he healed my injured body...

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.680
and trained me, despite my inexperience.

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:42.340
I trust him.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.200
So, move fast!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.590
Y-Yeah!

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.250
Himawari?

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.380
Himawari, what are you doing?!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.200
I can't abandon Takechi-sensei and just leave.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:07.300
He's the Mr. Ninja who saved my life.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.500
Wait!

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.040
Take me along.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.760
Don't leave me behind!

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.380
Go!

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:15.740
Mr. Ninja!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:21.910
He won't make it.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.000
Himawari!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:25.450
Mr. Ninja!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:32.140
Himawari, you've become a fine kunoichi.

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:36.440
I'm glad I saved you back then.

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.650
Mr. Ninja...

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:03.150
Follow me!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.180
We've escaped, but which way should we go now?

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.740
Follow me.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:08.890
Tsukiyohime!

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.640
It's awfully tight.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:20.890
Yes.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.270
It's a two-seater.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:23.640
Stop fussing.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.810
I didn't mean that.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.980
Um... Is this it?

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:31.780
Can you really pilot this thing?

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.320
"Just do it somehow." That's what Takechi-dono said.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:36.270
We're getting off, Himawari.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.750
It opened!

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.170
Yay!

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.870
Hayato-dono!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.030
The wing... came off.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.030
"Came off," my ass!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.770
But the point is that we got out.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.400
It's all over now.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.490
Yes.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:18.160
The other students are fine too.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.700
It's done.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.090
I'm glad everybody's all right.

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:30.170
But...

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.580
That's right. Shikimi-chan's master...

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.270
No. Apparently he's fine too.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:45.320
Shikimi!

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.590
Master!

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:50.340
Are you all right?

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:55.830
This idiot really tried to feed me to the birds.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.730
I almost died.

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.600
Sorry.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.600
I thought you'd died from the aconite.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.520
Your training is insufficient.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.850
I used the kind of aconite that wears off over time.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:15.030
I didn't want to be cremated or buried before I died.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.530
That's why I said feed me to the birds — to buy some time.

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:20.750
You really are a complete idiot.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.730
Shikimi...

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.470
Thank goodness, Master.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.180
I'm glad you're alive.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.080
You're still immature, Shikimi.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:37.010
I taught you that kunoichi should only shed tears to deceive others.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.890
No, Master.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:42.430
My true tears flow inside my heart.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.510
Then...

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.770
I will unite all the people and obtain their strength.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.530
A friend of mine taught me that.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:52.960
Her name is...

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.390
Himawari?

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:01.510
E-Everything a-all right?

00:17:01.510 --> 00:17:03.220
Um...

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.240
Probably.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:07.340
Should we change to horizontal cruising mode?

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:11.510
That's right. H-Horizontal... Horizontal...

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.330
There it is!

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.740
S-Switching to horizontal propulsion.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.090
All right. Full power!

00:17:19.090 --> 00:17:21.620
That's not it!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.140
Maybe we'd better bail out.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:30.030
Hold on!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.360
Where's our parachutes?

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.240
Didn't I tell you that this is a two-seater?

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.870
There are only two parachutes.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.310
This is the last one.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.310
Listen.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.410
Hold on tight!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.310
Okay!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:51.910
I'm going ahead.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:53.940
One, two...

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.350
What are you going to do, Hayato-dono?

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:57.220
This!

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.160
A bit more...

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:08.760
I did it!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:11.010
You've done it, Hayato-dono!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.000
Then just pull this.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.670
See you, Himawari.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:19.040
No, Hayato-dono!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:19.720
Idiot.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:20.910
Let go, Himawari!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.200
I won't!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.340
I...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.210
I couldn't even rescue my savior, Mr. Ninja.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:29.920
I won't let you die too.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.920
Himawari...

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.860
Listen, Himawari.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.700
This is just for one person.

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.660
At this rate, we'll both die.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.970
I can't hear you!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.900
If you're going to die, I'll die with you!

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:44.400
I don't want that!

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.650
Go, Himawari!

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.670
H-Hayato-dono!

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.670
Himawari!

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.960
Hayato-dono!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.480
No!

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:43.730
After that, the pharmaceutical company's operations were suspended because of their unlawful experiments.

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.800
The culprit, who had miraculously survived the explosion, was arrested.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:55.800
I'm sure Takechi-sensei saved him so that he could atone for his sins.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.310
And now...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:10.920
Shikimi-san is putting all her efforts into researching ways to return the modified ninjas to their original forms.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.610
Shikimi-sensei, please take a look at this.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:15.420
Sure.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.900
Of course, a few don't want to go back to their original forms.

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:26.440
I'll burn you all!

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:31.270
Himeji-san has become an action-movie actress.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:36.500
But sometimes she overdoes it, and the director scolds her.

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:42.120
Azami-chan travels around the world as a real spy.

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.220
According to my information,

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:48.710
the king of a certain country is taking a secret vacation with his queen.

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:54.230
Also, on his plane you can ask for twenty refills of fruit punch.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.190
Yay!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.630
However, sometimes she reports unnecessary information too.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:02.880
Sign: Yusura Yoezawa-kun Animal Land

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.490
Yonezawa-kun!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:09.050
Yusura-chan set up an animal theme park so that children could get closer to animals.

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:11.500
She's still lovey-dovey with Yonezawa-kun.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:20.330
And finally, me.

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:32.320
I returned to Grandma's village...

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:39.160
with Hayato-dono.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:05.730
The End

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:23.930
This is Asami-chan's Parabola.

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:26.340
Hayato-dono, you're terrible!

00:22:26.340 --> 00:22:28.560
Hey, look.

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.430
That's why I said I didn't want to use a one-man parachute.

00:22:30.690 --> 00:22:34.200
No way! You should've told me.

00:22:34.210 --> 00:22:38.040
But it was a race against time.

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:43.750
I want to continue my ninja training here...

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:48.360
until I become an outstanding ninja who can protect her master.

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:54.670
Though... it would be nice if this went on forever.
